{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 9, :comments [{:quotes [{:he "יאמר", :translit "yei'amar", :gloss "it is said"} {:he "על כן יאמר כנמרוד", :translit "al ken yei'amar k'nimrod", :gloss "therefore it is said like Nimrod"} {:he "על כן יאמר בספר מלחמות ה'", :translit "al ken yei'amar b'sefer milchamot Hashem", :gloss "therefore it is said in the Book of the Wars of the LORD"} {:he "ולציון יאמר איש ואיש יולד בה", :translit "u'l'tziyon yei'amar ish v'ish yulad bah", :gloss "and of Zion it shall be said, man and man is born in her"} {:he "ותהי ראשית ממלכתו בבל", :translit "vatehi reshit mamlachto babel", :gloss "and the beginning of his kingdom was Babel"} {:he "זה יולד בה", :translit "zeh yulad bah", :gloss "this one is born in her"}], :mechanisms [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["על כן יאמר כנמרוד" "על כן יאמר בספר מלחמות ה'" "ולציון יאמר איש ואיש יולד בה"]}], :frame {:text "The phrase על כן יאמר כנמרוד appears in Genesis 10:9 after Nimrod is called גבור ציד לפני ה' (Genesis 10:9). His kingdom's capital is identified as Babel (Genesis 10:10). על כן יאמר בספר מלחמות ה' is cited as a lost biblical book referenced at Numbers 21:14. ולציון יאמר איש ואיש יולד בה is from Psalms 87:5, where the psalmist describes Zion as a mother of nations, saying that of Zion it shall be said, 'this one and that one were born in her.' Ba'al HaTurim connects these three identical forms of יאמר to paint a portrait of military prowess: Nimrod conquered territory (Genesis 10:9–10), the Book of Wars preserves martial records (Numbers 21:14), and Zion's inhabitants are similarly described as distinguished warriors.", :sources ["Genesis 10:9" "Genesis 10:10" "Numbers 21:14" "Psalms 87:5"]}}], :arithmetic [{:kind :masorah, :count 3, :occurrences ["על כן יאמר כנמרוד" "על כן יאמר בספר מלחמות ה'" "ולציון יאמר איש ואיש יולד בה"], :by :selah, :located [{:phrase "על כן יאמר כנמרוד", :refs ["Genesis 10:9"], :n 1, :lens :plene-insensitive} {:phrase "על כן יאמר בספר מלחמות ה'", :refs [], :n 0, :lens :plene-insensitive} {:phrase "ולציון יאמר איש ואיש יולד בה", :refs ["Psalms 87:5"], :n 1, :lens :plene-insensitive}]}], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 10, :discipline "bht-chalkboard-v1", :timestamp "2026-07-12T23:05:26.954598210Z", :model "glm-5.2"}